<title>FRANCE: Cie des Signaux H1 net 42 mln Ffr.</title>
<headline>Cie des Signaux H1 net 42 mln Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>Net attributable, excl exceptionals</p>
<p>	and before goodwill amortisation   42  vs  0</p>
<p>Net attributable</p>
<p>	before goodwill amortisation	276  vs  loss   46</p>
<p>    Pre-tax, pre-exceptional		 42  vs	    8</p>
<p>    Exceptional gains			 234  vs  loss   46</p>
<p>    Turnover				    915  vs	  778</p>
<p>NOTE - Compagnie des Signaux gave its results in a statement. It said it expected a increase in net profit for full-year 1996, excluding exceptional elements and capital gains, compared with 1995. The electronics and defence group said the company expected 1996 sales of 1.9 billion francs with orders increasing by 10 percent.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
